            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "David L Cingranelli"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used sweet Italian sausage crumbled up instead of the pancetta. I also added parsley and basil to the marinara sauce. I like to chop up celery and sometimes I Some shredded carrots. I think they add layers of flavor. However, I’m sure its great just as written. Thanks for sharing this recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2022-07-24T17:47:05.271Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
